# The Godfather Theme (Harmonica)

Diatonic C

Positive numbers are blow notes.
Negative numbers are draw notes.

```
 5  -6   7  -7  -6   7  -6

-7  -6  -5   6   5

 5  -6   7  -7  -6   7  -6

-7  -6  -5   5  -4

-4  -5  -6  -7

-4  -5   6  -6

-6   7   6  -5   5

 6  -5  -5   5   5   6  -6
```

